WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Raw files become verified knowledge.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Collect: hash, deduplicate, classify, and estimate.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Structure: adaptive routes preserve page and block identity.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Verify: numeric, table, continuity, and source hard gates.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Measured portfolio: 270 formal inference cases.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Knowledge: notes, entities, and evidence-backed relations.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Connect: every relation can return to its source.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
Package: Markdown, Obsidian, RAG JSONL, and JSON-LD.

00:48.000 --> 00:60.000
Structara. Compile the knowledge.
